All the threads all make the same assumptions -- demon lord encounters are a one time event. What if 
you guarantee a demon lord encounter on the way back up with the Amulet? The first encounter you get 
off easy IF you "make a deal with the devil". The second part of that deal: when you return with the 
amulet, you must surrender "your soul" -- such as your poison intrinsic, speed intrinsic, fire 
resistance intrinsic, etc. If you don't give one random intrinsic voluntarily, every time the demon 
lord hits, the demon lord has a chance of taking an intrinsic. And if you go the combat route, the 
demon lord won't be satisfied with just the one intrinsic promised in the deal.

The demon lord would stand on the up stairs until the deal was completed.

Of course you can bypass the demon lord with the appropriate method. But my ascension runs, the 
magic force always seems to choose the demon lord levels for reruns.


